<title>USA: Jones Medical Industries Inc  Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Jones Medical Industries Inc  Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.24		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net			  6,763		    3,889</p>
<p> Revs			26,343		   21,899</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  28,764		   24,823</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1995, full-year 1996 and full-year 1995 results restated to reflect Daniels acquisition on August 30, 1996.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.80		    $0.50</p>
<p> Net			 22,389		   12,389</p>
<p> Revs		     100,153		   74,792</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,965		   24,844</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1996 results before one-time after-tax acquisition charge of $4,298,000 related to Daniels acquisition.</p>
<p>Including charge full-year 1996 net income was $18,139,000 and earnings per share were $0.65.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
